{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>宜家家居在尖沙咀K11藝術購物館分店的美食站，一個雪糕樣本大腸菌群含量超標。</p><p></p><p>食安中心指，結果顯示大腸菌群含量為每克一百五十個，超出每克不可含有多於一百個大腸菌群的法例上限。中心已知會店鋪，即時停售及銷毀所有有問題的雪糕。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T16:03:52.980422+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T14:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T15:57:15.892299+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T15:57:15.892299+00:00","content_hash":"874ea7f7ea5bccb9f15c113b49710130445833e05b62bbce90089b04236d4114","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}